(6993330, 1056330, 16106, '<td valign="top">I do wish you had gotten the bottom of that window in frame. the presented image is so chopped up, and I think if the wall had been allowed to snake around the window as it does above the sign, it would have really helped unify what is still a good image image, but not wow.</td>', 'I do wish you had gotten the bottom of that window in frame. the presented image is so chopped up, and I think if the wall had been allowed to snake around the window as it does above the sign, it would have really helped unify what is still a good image image, but not wow.', '2013-03-06 20:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993333, 1056475, 16106, '<td valign="top">All the focus seems to be on the cat, I can see something is going on with the goats, and you tell me it is a birth, but ......</td>', 'All the focus seems to be on the cat, I can see something is going on with the goats, and you tell me it is a birth, but ......', '2013-03-06 20:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993336, 1056683, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I wish you had cropped out that dead sky and rotated it to vertical with a bit more pop in saturation, a tighter crop and a touch of sharpening, this Would have been on the front page.</td>', 'Great capture. I wish you had cropped out that dead sky and rotated it to vertical with a bit more pop in saturation, a tighter crop and a touch of sharpening, this Would have been on the front page.', '2013-03-06 20:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993337, 1056691, 16106, '<td valign="top">S is for sense of scale. I like the processing and framing, but for all I know this is a lawn tractor taken with a very wide lens. Big is only big when it is next to something smaller.</td>', 'S is for sense of scale. I like the processing and framing, but for all I know this is a lawn tractor taken with a very wide lens. Big is only big when it is next to something smaller.', '2013-03-06 20:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993339, 1056589, 16106, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and nice DOF, but the subject is a bit boring for those of us looking at pictures on laptops.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and nice DOF, but the subject is a bit boring for those of us looking at pictures on laptops.', '2013-03-06 21:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993341, 1056692, 16106, '<td valign="top">i you had called it <i>Bustier</i> I''ll bet you would have picked up a full point. Nice lighting and well framed.</td>', 'i you had called it Bustier I''ll bet you would have picked up a full point. Nice lighting and well framed.', '2013-03-06 21:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993356, 1056692, 124982, '<td valign="top">B is for a B-cup? Joking aside, this is actually very nicely done. The lighting is great, processing is smooth and tones very good. Well done on what I guess is meant to be a provocative image and title.</td>', 'B is for a B-cup? Joking aside, this is actually very nicely done. The lighting is great, processing is smooth and tones very good. Well done on what I guess is meant to be a provocative image and title.', '2013-03-06 21:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993357, 1056521, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very hard, very gritty and very nicely done. I appreciate images like this just as much as the pretty landscapes etc. Love the detail and texture in the wire. And the spiderweb is such a nice touch!</td>', 'Very hard, very gritty and very nicely done. I appreciate images like this just as much as the pretty landscapes etc. Love the detail and texture in the wire. And the spiderweb is such a nice touch!', '2013-03-06 21:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993359, 1056306, 124982, '<td valign="top">I double love some double bass, for sure!! Lovely image, very smoothly done. Strings look a smidge soft and out of focus...but that''s nitpicking.</td>', 'I double love some double bass, for sure!! Lovely image, very smoothly done. Strings look a smidge soft and out of focus...but that''s nitpicking.', '2013-03-06 21:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993360, 1056404, 124982, '<td valign="top">Your model most certainly is beautiful!! Unfortunately the processing has ket this portrait down -- there is some very serious halo''ing artifact around the gree in the background and over her right shoulder.</td>', 'Your model most certainly is beautiful!! Unfortunately the processing has ket this portrait down -- there is some very serious halo''ing artifact around the gree in the background and over her right shoulder.', '2013-03-06 21:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993362, 1056766, 124982, '<td valign="top">A very unique perspective -- guessing this was taken with a wide angle lens? Her legs seem to go forever!! Although the challenge is "B is for...". I almost don''t care so much about the bridge as I want to see her face clearer and in more detail! Quite an interesting image. I like it.</td>', 'A very unique perspective -- guessing this was taken with a wide angle lens? Her legs seem to go forever!! Although the challenge is "B is for...". I almost don''t care so much about the bridge as I want to see her face clearer and in more detail! Quite an interesting image. I like it.', '2013-03-06 21:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993363, 1056674, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice vintage feel to this image with the choice of processing. Lovely detail in the jeans and sweater!</td>', 'Nice vintage feel to this image with the choice of processing. Lovely detail in the jeans and sweater!', '2013-03-06 21:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993364, 1056207, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. While technically very good, I just don''t enjoy the choice of colors. The blue is more purple than blue and the three colors together just don''t seem to pop, they seem somewhat flat? Maybe it''s my monitor?</td>', 'Very nicely done. While technically very good, I just don''t enjoy the choice of colors. The blue is more purple than blue and the three colors together just don''t seem to pop, they seem somewhat flat? Maybe it''s my monitor?', '2013-03-06 21:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993366, 1056716, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very whimsical, yet quite appealing. Love the detail in the books, and the tones in the image overall. Has a definite B&amp;W feel to it which makes it stand out. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very whimsical, yet quite appealing. Love the detail in the books, and the tones in the image overall. Has a definite B&W feel to it which makes it stand out. Very nicely done.', '2013-03-06 21:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
