(6995047, 1056716, 100495, '<td valign="top">"Oh, you''d love Italy," said the smug wooden bird, "it''s full of art and beauty and adventure. When I finally fledge I''m going to fly to Florence and soak up the wonderful atmosphere of thousands of years of history and culture".<br/> <br/>"Feck me!" exclaimed the fish, "A talking wooden bird!".<br/> <br/>Excellent atmospheric shot and a well-deserved 10.</td>', '"Oh, you''d love Italy," said the smug wooden bird, "it''s full of art and beauty and adventure. When I finally fledge I''m going to fly to Florence and soak up the wonderful atmosphere of thousands of years of history and culture". "Feck me!" exclaimed the fish, "A talking wooden bird!". Excellent atmospheric shot and a well-deserved 10.', '2013-03-08 05:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995051, 1055460, 100495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Brenda lived to sing. Unfortunately she was a terrible singer and regularly got complaints from her neighbours who banged on the walls and ceiling when she warbled. But she''d show them; one day she''d be a star and get top billing on Broadway, as long as she kept practising.<br/> <br/>Great shot and lovely negative space and lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful Brenda lived to sing. Unfortunately she was a terrible singer and regularly got complaints from her neighbours who banged on the walls and ceiling when she warbled. But she''d show them; one day she''d be a star and get top billing on Broadway, as long as she kept practising. Great shot and lovely negative space and lighting.', '2013-03-08 05:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995053, 1056228, 100495, '<td valign="top">As the sun dropped, the sea bubbled and frothed and boiled and rolled. The High Priests of Zolo waited in anticipation for Her arrival, salivating at the thought of their imminent ascension to Zolo heaven. "Hang on a minute," said Phil, the lead priest, "it''s just an illusion, we''re all wearing our ND4 glasses again. It''s just another normal day".<br/> <br/>Then they went home, slightly disappointed.<br/> <br/>Great shot and colours. Should do very well.</td>', 'As the sun dropped, the sea bubbled and frothed and boiled and rolled. The High Priests of Zolo waited in anticipation for Her arrival, salivating at the thought of their imminent ascension to Zolo heaven. "Hang on a minute," said Phil, the lead priest, "it''s just an illusion, we''re all wearing our ND4 glasses again. It''s just another normal day". Then they went home, slightly disappointed. Great shot and colours. Should do very well.', '2013-03-08 05:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995055, 1056692, 100495, '<td valign="top">"Hello! Hello! I''m up here. Hello!"<br/> <br/>Lovely light and atmosphere.</td>', '"Hello! Hello! I''m up here. Hello!" Lovely light and atmosphere.', '2013-03-08 05:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995061, 1056207, 100495, '<td valign="top">Every year it was the same. 2 bottles of ''clown water'' from the Clown Club to mark another birthday, another 365 days of making up and putting on his ridiculous shoes, another year of driving his terrible car with the fally-off doors. "Next year," he said to himself, "next year I''ll have my MBA and get to run a bank".<br/> <br/>Nice version of the classic ''bottle shot''. Good colours and clarity.</td>', 'Every year it was the same. 2 bottles of ''clown water'' from the Clown Club to mark another birthday, another 365 days of making up and putting on his ridiculous shoes, another year of driving his terrible car with the fally-off doors. "Next year," he said to himself, "next year I''ll have my MBA and get to run a bank". Nice version of the classic ''bottle shot''. Good colours and clarity.', '2013-03-08 05:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995064, 1056541, 100495, '<td valign="top">As the sun dropped and the holiday-makers went back to their hotels to party, the kayaks snuggled up to keep warm against the cold Pacific breeze. "Tomorrow," the told themselves each night, "tomorrow we''ll get to go to Chile", but of course they never would.<br/> <br/>Lovely light and atmosphere, but photos I like usually bomb. Sorry!</td>', 'As the sun dropped and the holiday-makers went back to their hotels to party, the kayaks snuggled up to keep warm against the cold Pacific breeze. "Tomorrow," the told themselves each night, "tomorrow we''ll get to go to Chile", but of course they never would. Lovely light and atmosphere, but photos I like usually bomb. Sorry!', '2013-03-08 06:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995069, 1056744, 100495, '<td valign="top">It wasn''t the most interesting or enjoyable team-building day, but the finance section was determined to make the most of it. They just needed to remember to forget that the IT section got a week in Miami.<br/> <br/>Good shot.</td>', 'It wasn''t the most interesting or enjoyable team-building day, but the finance section was determined to make the most of it. They just needed to remember to forget that the IT section got a week in Miami. Good shot.', '2013-03-08 06:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995076, 1056379, 100495, '<td valign="top">The box had had an interesting life. Once it held important cryptic messages for Polish spies working as double agents for the KGB in West Germany. When ''Rudolf'' was picked up by the Police the box went to a thrift store where Keith bought it to store his pens, but he always got a bad vibe when the lights were turned off and the box whispered messages about its interesting past. Now it lives in the shed, empty, remembering the old days, whispering to itself in the dark. When the light comes on, it stops.<br/> <br/>Great atmospheric shot.</td>', 'The box had had an interesting life. Once it held important cryptic messages for Polish spies working as double agents for the KGB in West Germany. When ''Rudolf'' was picked up by the Police the box went to a thrift store where Keith bought it to store his pens, but he always got a bad vibe when the lights were turned off and the box whispered messages about its interesting past. Now it lives in the shed, empty, remembering the old days, whispering to itself in the dark. When the light comes on, it stops. Great atmospheric shot.', '2013-03-08 06:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995077, 1056749, 100495, '<td valign="top">"Set the controls for the heart of the sun," shouted the Captain, "we''ve got to shake off the Banty patrol interceptor and get the Quad twins to safety!"<br/> <br/>"Dave! Dave! Wake up!" shouted Kevin.<br/> <br/>Dave woke and went back to his menial job, monitoring space for the signs of extra-terrestial intelligence that he knew he would never find. They were out there, but they didn''t want to speak to us.<br/> <br/>Very engaging photo.</td>', '"Set the controls for the heart of the sun," shouted the Captain, "we''ve got to shake off the Banty patrol interceptor and get the Quad twins to safety!" "Dave! Dave! Wake up!" shouted Kevin. Dave woke and went back to his menial job, monitoring space for the signs of extra-terrestial intelligence that he knew he would never find. They were out there, but they didn''t want to speak to us. Very engaging photo.', '2013-03-08 06:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995080, 1056779, 100495, '<td valign="top">''Fluffy'' had heard all the songs a million times or more. They were played well on a good instrument, but he knew the money wouldn''t roll in until he started doing his dog dance. The star of the show was waiting for the right moment with the right lighting and the right crowd. He was 3 dances away from the $250 he needed for a flight to Hollywood to become a film star, or work in a restaurant if it failed.</td>', '''Fluffy'' had heard all the songs a million times or more. They were played well on a good instrument, but he knew the money wouldn''t roll in until he started doing his dog dance. The star of the show was waiting for the right moment with the right lighting and the right crowd. He was 3 dances away from the $250 he needed for a flight to Hollywood to become a film star, or work in a restaurant if it failed.', '2013-03-08 06:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995089, 1056523, 100495, '<td valign="top">"But I told you it was my Mother''s birthday next weekend. It''s the same day every year, remember?"<br/> <br/>Dave could feel his ''weekend with the boys'' slipping away with every exasperated breath from her beautiful mouth. As time went on he questioned why he stayed with her and her endless demands for attention and commitment. Maybe it was her huge trust fund.<br/> <br/> <br/>Very atmospheric shot, full of emotion.</td>', '"But I told you it was my Mother''s birthday next weekend. It''s the same day every year, remember?" Dave could feel his ''weekend with the boys'' slipping away with every exasperated breath from her beautiful mouth. As time went on he questioned why he stayed with her and her endless demands for attention and commitment. Maybe it was her huge trust fund.  Very atmospheric shot, full of emotion.', '2013-03-08 06:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995093, 1056192, 100495, '<td valign="top">"Mum, you need to listen to me. Either use more or less aperture. My bunny ears are either too in-focus or too out-of-focus. Maybe focus on my eyes rather than my nose. Mum, are you listening??"<br/> <br/>Despite being a pro photographer for 8 years nobody ever listened to Rex''s suggestions, but he was such a cutey.<br/> <br/>A very engaging and humourous shot.</td>', '"Mum, you need to listen to me. Either use more or less aperture. My bunny ears are either too in-focus or too out-of-focus. Maybe focus on my eyes rather than my nose. Mum, are you listening??" Despite being a pro photographer for 8 years nobody ever listened to Rex''s suggestions, but he was such a cutey. A very engaging and humourous shot.', '2013-03-08 06:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995106, 1056544, 100495, '<td valign="top">Harry spent his days looking for his birth certificate. He''d definately put it in a book for ''safe keeping'', but the book disappeared and his chance of citizenship along with it. He had found a photo of Obama in a compromising clinch with a woman, and he kept this in his bag for future blackmailing opportunities, but he really needed his birth certificate.<br/> <br/>Nice pic</td>', 'Harry spent his days looking for his birth certificate. He''d definately put it in a book for ''safe keeping'', but the book disappeared and his chance of citizenship along with it. He had found a photo of Obama in a compromising clinch with a woman, and he kept this in his bag for future blackmailing opportunities, but he really needed his birth certificate. Nice pic', '2013-03-08 07:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
