(6995597, 1056707, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the soft incandescent light cast on the subject. The composition is done very well with the objects consecutively leading me through the shot. (Light, persons face, book, blurred sculpture) Black and white is always a nice choice. I think there is descent contrast here. A few things that may be conceived as needing improvement are the noise and lack of detail/sharpness on the persons face. I like it overall.</td>', 'I like the soft incandescent light cast on the subject. The composition is done very well with the objects consecutively leading me through the shot. (Light, persons face, book, blurred sculpture) Black and white is always a nice choice. I think there is descent contrast here. A few things that may be conceived as needing improvement are the noise and lack of detail/sharpness on the persons face. I like it overall.', '2013-03-08 18:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995601, 1056433, 10785, '<td valign="top">A technically very good shot. I am not seeing a definitive focal point amongst the clutter of the borough. I am guessing it is the hotel, which is where the line of the street leads.</td>', 'A technically very good shot. I am not seeing a definitive focal point amongst the clutter of the borough. I am guessing it is the hotel, which is where the line of the street leads.', '2013-03-08 18:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
