(6995947, 1056654, 31239, '<td valign="top">Ok image, sky is a bit burnt out which doesn''t help the image, this also makes various parts of the image disappear which in unfortunate.<br/>Also, the bench isn''t the main focal point of the image, but a side feature, and not that much of a feature, so submitting this into a competition and naming this as the subject is clutching at straws really.<br/>Not too sure about the processing / border either.<br/> <br/>Sorry to be so extensive in my comments, but I hope this helps when choosing images for future competitions.</td>', 'Ok image, sky is a bit burnt out which doesn''t help the image, this also makes various parts of the image disappear which in unfortunate.Also, the bench isn''t the main focal point of the image, but a side feature, and not that much of a feature, so submitting this into a competition and naming this as the subject is clutching at straws really.Not too sure about the processing / border either. Sorry to be so extensive in my comments, but I hope this helps when choosing images for future competitions.', '2013-03-09 14:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995951, 1056324, 31239, '<td valign="top">Including the people on the bridge really helps bring this image to life, and brings a scale to the bridge.<br/>Well seen.</td>', 'Including the people on the bridge really helps bring this image to life, and brings a scale to the bridge.Well seen.', '2013-03-09 15:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995952, 1056488, 31239, '<td valign="top">Shame you are not closer to make the act of "Bouldering" more prominent in the from, the out of focus brush in the foreground is a little over powering</td>', 'Shame you are not closer to make the act of "Bouldering" more prominent in the from, the out of focus brush in the foreground is a little over powering', '2013-03-09 15:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995953, 1056696, 31239, '<td valign="top">I guess the title is supposed to start with B, so I assume you mean "Bowling" rather than "My party"<br/> <br/>as an action shot goes it is lacking in a movement, it is a little static, if there was movement in the ball or the bowlers arm this would add an extra dimension to the image.</td>', 'I guess the title is supposed to start with B, so I assume you mean "Bowling" rather than "My party" as an action shot goes it is lacking in a movement, it is a little static, if there was movement in the ball or the bowlers arm this would add an extra dimension to the image.', '2013-03-09 15:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995955, 1056636, 100495, '<td valign="top">It was inevitable really. She was a high flying lawyer with great teeth and a good future, he was a down-town mechanic, a ''back-street guy'' if you like. She''d never had a back-street guy, and her Mother never told her why, but he was gonna try. And he did. And they were happy for several months until she realised they had nothing in common. He didn''t even know what a lawyer was.<br/> <br/>Lots of emotion here</td>', 'It was inevitable really. She was a high flying lawyer with great teeth and a good future, he was a down-town mechanic, a ''back-street guy'' if you like. She''d never had a back-street guy, and her Mother never told her why, but he was gonna try. And he did. And they were happy for several months until she realised they had nothing in common. He didn''t even know what a lawyer was. Lots of emotion here', '2013-03-09 15:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
