(6998093, 1056757, 83149, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, but the other skiers, especially the one in the bottom left are distracting.  If you could have gotten this shot with only the snow in the background and some work on the colours and sharpening this would have been a great picture.</td>', 'Nice action shot, but the other skiers, especially the one in the bottom left are distracting.  If you could have gotten this shot with only the snow in the background and some work on the colours and sharpening this would have been a great picture.', '2013-03-12 20:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
