(6998100, 1056599, 83149, '<td valign="top">The boy on the right has a great expression and is reasonably well lit.  Unfortunately the boy on the left has neither of these things.  It was a great idea, the execution just needs a little work.</td>', 'The boy on the right has a great expression and is reasonably well lit.  Unfortunately the boy on the left has neither of these things.  It was a great idea, the execution just needs a little work.', '2013-03-12 20:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
