(6998644, 1056774, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by giantmike:</b></div><hr/><i> That crazy hair/wig is really distracting me from the natural movement of this image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I found this rather funny.  It''s the fur lined edges of the hood on her coat.  This was taken outside at 4 degrees.</td>', 'Originally posted by giantmike: That crazy hair/wig is really distracting me from the natural movement of this image.   I found this rather funny.  It''s the fur lined edges of the hood on her coat.  This was taken outside at 4 degrees.', '2013-03-13 06:01:11.000000', NULL, 0),
