(6998714, 1056657, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nygold:</b></div><hr/><i> Paul this was my pick for the blue ribbon.<br/>Seagulls are arguably the most photographed bird in the world and we have seen <br/>thousands upon thousands of seagull shots to compare this too.<br/>BUT to have this kind of action and reaction in a seagull shot(or any wildlife shot)for that matter is just superb.<br/>You have taken the ordinary and made it extraordinary.<br/>On top of that I see 3 B''s in your shot Birds, Beach, Bite. What more could you ask for.<br/>This is truely a shot to be proud of.<br/> <br/>On a side note Hahn23 said these are ring-billed gulls but judging by their size and the tip of their beaks being black my guess would be Herring gull.<br/>It''s a bit hard to tell from the picture but that would be my guess.<br/>Again congrats on a great shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for your kind words and lovely feedback. I was very pleased with the action I captured however I did feel the photo was missing something and I suspect this was due to the distance from which I took the shot causing the original photo not to be too sharp. Hence my attempts to process it to look better. I did feel it was lacking and wished I had a better zoom lens or had got closer to the action.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1058307" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058307.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058307.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058307.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I have no idea what type of gulls they are - the shot was taken at Lyme Regis in Dorset in the UK if that helps. Also here are some other shots from the same day.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1058303" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058303.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058303.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058303.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1058304" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058304.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058304.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058304.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1058305" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058305.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058305.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058305.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1058306" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058306.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058306.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1058306.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by nygold: Paul this was my pick for the blue ribbon.Seagulls are arguably the most photographed bird in the world and we have seen thousands upon thousands of seagull shots to compare this too.BUT to have this kind of action and reaction in a seagull shot(or any wildlife shot)for that matter is just superb.You have taken the ordinary and made it extraordinary.On top of that I see 3 B''s in your shot Birds, Beach, Bite. What more could you ask for.This is truely a shot to be proud of. On a side note Hahn23 said these are ring-billed gulls but judging by their size and the tip of their beaks being black my guess would be Herring gull.It''s a bit hard to tell from the picture but that would be my guess.Again congrats on a great shot.   Thank you for your kind words and lovely feedback. I was very pleased with the action I captured however I did feel the photo was missing something and I suspect this was due to the distance from which I took the shot causing the original photo not to be too sharp. Hence my attempts to process it to look better. I did feel it was lacking and wished I had a better zoom lens or had got closer to the action.   I have no idea what type of gulls they are - the shot was taken at Lyme Regis in Dorset in the UK if that helps. Also here are some other shots from the same day.         ', '2013-03-13 08:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6998764, 1056725, 103142, '<td valign="top">definitely a live bird. I was just hoping they wouldn''t go to the bathroom on the old books. :)</td>', 'definitely a live bird. I was just hoping they wouldn''t go to the bathroom on the old books. :)', '2013-03-13 09:29:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6998774, 1056657, 153814, '<td valign="top"><i>I have no idea what type of gulls they are - the shot was taken at Lyme Regis in Dorset in the UK if that helps. Also here are some other shots from the same day. <br/></i> <br/>After looking at the other shots and also now knowing the location I would go with<br/>European herring gull.<br/> <br/>Considering how far away you were from the gulls I thing you did a great job with the PP.<br/></td>', 'I have no idea what type of gulls they are - the shot was taken at Lyme Regis in Dorset in the UK if that helps. Also here are some other shots from the same day.  After looking at the other shots and also now knowing the location I would go withEuropean herring gull. Considering how far away you were from the gulls I thing you did a great job with the PP.', '2013-03-13 09:38:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6998861, 1056449, 69324, '<td valign="top">Surprised at the score, I was one of your 8 votes, It''s a good macro shot.</td>', 'Surprised at the score, I was one of your 8 votes, It''s a good macro shot.', '2013-03-13 11:45:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6998916, 1056793, 74911, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> What is the gold band? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Those are just gold bracelets. Kinda baby ornaments. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: What is the gold band?   Those are just gold bracelets. Kinda baby ornaments. :)', '2013-03-13 12:57:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6998946, 1056541, 10003, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much for all the encouraging comments. I am SO tickled to be on the front page!!  <br/> <br/>Too bad it won''t last. I''m in the bad habit of deleting my files without saving the original raw. Then I entered anyway thinking, "there''s no way it will make top ten".  <br/> <br/>So I''m angry with myself but very excited this did so well.  My first (if temporary) ribbon and personal best.<br/> <br/>Lesson learned:  believe in myself.<br/> <br/>Thank you!</td>', 'Thank you so much for all the encouraging comments. I am SO tickled to be on the front page!!   Too bad it won''t last. I''m in the bad habit of deleting my files without saving the original raw. Then I entered anyway thinking, "there''s no way it will make top ten".   So I''m angry with myself but very excited this did so well.  My first (if temporary) ribbon and personal best. Lesson learned:  believe in myself. Thank you!', '2013-03-13 13:13:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6999096, 1056674, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great stuff here. Thanks for sharing this one.</td>', 'Great stuff here. Thanks for sharing this one.', '2013-03-13 13:55:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6999127, 1056465, 19825, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. The lighting is really nice. I don''t know if the vignette is natural or added in processing, but it enhances things well. The chair or whatever it is to the right could have been removed. Nice shot.<br/> <br/>So, you don''t have to bribe him to be your model? I am lucky it was just a pack of gum.</td>', 'I like this a lot. The lighting is really nice. I don''t know if the vignette is natural or added in processing, but it enhances things well. The chair or whatever it is to the right could have been removed. Nice shot. So, you don''t have to bribe him to be your model? I am lucky it was just a pack of gum.', '2013-03-13 14:51:09.000000', NULL, 0),
